turtle(some_turtle_1). @ "Some turtles can be spotted near the campus."
near_campus(some_turtle_1). @ "Some turtles can be spotted near the campus."
animal(V) & near_campus(V) => rabbit(V) | squirrel(V). @ "The only animals that can be spotted near the campus are rabbits and squirrels."
